A||||1||Lewis||Oil pressure guage erratic...||||5||
Z||000000||Lewis||05-30-2000||08:40 AM||||My oil pressure guage becomes erratic when the car is idling.  Also does it when I drive.  Just moves up and down sometimes not all the time.  Car runs ok does not give me any problems when I drive it.  Does no go any lower that 275.  Is this normal or do I have somekind or problem.  Car does go down to about 700 to 900 rpm when it idles.  The guage goes up and down with the idle.  85gt,6cyl,auto....thanks..any help would be appreciated....Lewis||||reg||5
Z||000001||wxxo||05-30-2000||01:40 PM||||check your sending unit. mine does the same thing because the battery cable will break the connection between the unit and the wiring harness. meaning that if you are not careful when putting the cable back on the battery it will sit in a way that it will actually push on the sending unit. try to see if pushing unit back down will help. ||||reg||1
